## Harness

<!-- The absolute path behind <plugin-root> is shown on the 'self-test' line of every session briefing -->

The operating rules (reversibility classification·entry conditions·minimal change) are **injected automatically at session start**.
Work routing (P0~P6) and reference freshness are loaded every session by `.claude/rules/workflow-routing.md`,
and the remaining work rules load conditionally from `.claude/rules/` according to the edit path.

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `bash <plugin-root>/scripts/doctor.sh` | Harness self-test (hooks·rules·graph) |
| `bash <plugin-root>/scripts/doctor.sh --usage` | Hook liveness·skill invocations·edge instrumentation |
| `bash <plugin-root>/scripts/doctor.sh --lessons` | Lesson aggregation + promotion candidates |
